<!--
  The themed-icon layer (Android 13+). The system discards these colours and tints
  the alpha channel with the user's chosen wallpaper palette, so what matters here
  is only the shape — which is why it is the same two paths as the foreground, with
  no gradient anywhere near it. A tinted gradient would come out as a flat blob.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
